OL,3,AWhat is PHP and why did it spark a
OL,4,Aglobal cyber-security scramble?
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor more than a decade, serious flaws
OL,7,Fhad gone undetected in technology
OL,8,Funderpinning much of the internet.
OL,10,FIt took artificial intelligence (AI) to
OL,11,Fbring them to light and caused a global
OL,12,Fcyber-security alert.
OL,14,FThe vulnerabilities lie within a
OL,15,Fprogramming language called PHP, which
OL,16,Fhas been used internationally since the
OL,17,F2000s to build websites.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
