OL,3,AWhat is PHP and why did it spark a
OL,4,Aglobal cyber-security scramble?
OL,5,
OL,6,FGovernments and cyber-security agencies
OL,7,Faround the world scrambled to contain
OL,8,Fthe fallout of this discovery on
OL,9,FWednesday, and have urged website
OL,10,Foperators to install a new emergency
OL,11,Ffix or consider taking their platforms
OL,12,Foffline.
